{
  "id": "E398",
  "title": "Check It Again",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2020-01-29",
  "synopsis": "Little Fang brought dice to his exam, but why?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50398/6dd0d41667c48442402a88a1b10b8976a695419f.mp3?1580203683",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "再检查一下\n\n老师：你为什么带色子来考试？\n小方：我不会的题就用色子做。\n老师：那你为什么一直在用色子？\n小方：因为很多题我都不会做。\n老师：那为什么你做完以后，还在用色子？\n小方：我要再检查一下啊。\n",
    "traditional": "再檢查一下\n\n老師：你為什麼帶色子來考試？\n小方：我不會的題就用色子做。\n老師：那你為什麼一直在用色子？\n小方：因為很多題我都不會做。\n老師：那為什麼你做完以後，還在用色子？\n小方：我要再檢查一下啊。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Check it again"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "老师：你为什么带色子来考试？",
      "traditional": "老師：你為什麼帶色子來考試？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nǐ wèi shén me dài shǎi zi lái kǎo shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Why did you bring dice to the exam?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小方：我不会的题就用色子做。",
      "traditional": "小方：我不會的題就用色子做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo fāng wǒ bú huì de tí jiù yòng shǎi zi zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Fang: I used the dice to do the questions that I didn’t know."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "老师：那你为什么一直在用色子？",
      "traditional": "老師：那你為什麼一直在用色子？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nà nǐ wèi shén me yì zhí zài yòng shǎi zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Then why did you keep rolling the dice?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小方：因为很多题我都不会做。",
      "traditional": "小方：因為很多題我都不會做。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo fāng yīn wèi hěn duō tí wǒ dōu bú huì zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Fang: Because there were a lot of questions that I couldn’t do."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "老师：那为什么你做完以后，还在用色子？",
      "traditional": "老師：那為什麼你做完以後，還在用色子？",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī nà wèi shén me nǐ zuò wán yǐ hòu hái zài yòng shǎi zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Teacher: Then why were you still rolling the dice after finishing the exam?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小方：我要再检查一下啊。",
      "traditional": "小方：我要再檢查一下啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo fāng wǒ yào zài jiǎn chá yí xià a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Fang: I needed to check it again."
    }
  ],
